# GenesisClosureReceipt schema — common (root-cycle) shape.
# Record-judgment reading (premath.record-judgments.v0): this schema
# file is a COMPILED ARTIFACT per RJ-1.6 — the statement is the type,
# this file is data, never executable authority. Directive law map:
# require = telescope extension premise (RJ-1.1 shape);
# enum / literal / enum_prefix = atomic-predicate membership (RJ-1.5).
# Note: cycle boat-2026-05-17 additionally requires predecessor_boundary_ref
# and carried_seed_manifest_ref; the cycle's own checker enforces those.
header GenesisClosureReceipt
require receipt_id
require cycle_id
require recorder
require authority_surface
require final_recording_channel_witness_ref
require founding_witness_chain_root_ref
require closure_handoff_witness_ref
require operating_regime_opened
literal recorder Tusk
literal authority_surface founding-witness-chain
